@DungeonsAndDragqueens_HostAddress = http://localhost:5209
@Token = paste-login-token-here

### Register (password must contain at least 12 characters)
POST {{DungeonsAndDragqueens_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "example_player",
  "password": "this-is-a-long-demo-password"
}

### List your characters
GET {{DungeonsAndDragqueens_HostAddress}}/StoreCharacters
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

### List available monsters
GET {{DungeonsAndDragqueens_HostAddress}}/StoreMonsters?page=1&pageSize=100
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

### List swords
GET {{DungeonsAndDragqueens_HostAddress}}/StoreSwords
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json
